kind: TaskDialog
modelDescription: |-
  Reads one saved Gate 1 approval request and its decision records using the exact Gate1ApprovalRequestID. Ask for the ID if missing; never generate or substitute one.

  Reports whether request and decision records agree on identity, scope, reviewer, snapshot, and status. Confirm saved Gate 1 approval only when RecordsConsistent=true and Gate1ApprovalConfirmed=true. A rejected, pending, missing, duplicated, or inconsistent result does not establish approval.

  Approval applies only to the saved review snapshot. It does not establish current-run readiness, complete discovery coverage, verified event facts, or permission to execute searches.

  This tool is read-only. It does not create requests, record decisions, execute searches, or change run status. Report returned outcomes accurately.
outputs:
  - propertyName: gate1approvalstatusresult

action:
  kind: InvokeFlowTaskAction
  flowId: 4f2f421c-60d2-f111-a05b-70a8a599229b
  connectionProperties:
    $kind: ConnectionProperties
    diagnostics:
    mode: Invoker

outputMode: All